	(text "CAN - machine control link (decision 2026-08-22; vault Control Electronics open item). STM32F412 CAN1 (PA11 RX / PA12 TX) -> TJA1051T/3 -> split termination (2x62R + 4.7nF, solder-jumper JP70 bridged) + PESD1CAN -> pads CANH/CANL/GND. Classic CAN 500 kbit/s. Layout: CANH/CANL as a tight pair, transceiver and termination next to the pads, D70 nearest the pads."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 30 40 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
		)
